    "stack": ["IntersectionObserver", "CSS @keyframes", "requestAnimationFrame", "Astro (scoped CSS)"],
    "reduced_motion": "respected"
  },
  "notes": "Colors sampled from the site's real custom-property ramps (--base-color-neutral-*/blue-*, --text-color-*, --color-brand-*), corroborated by the frequency-ranked computed styles. rgb(90,96,114)=#5a6072 is the single most-used text color. Chart-series hues (purple/green/yellow/orange/coral) are read from the demo bar charts, not the neutral UI; approximate. No dark theme (craft.theme.supportsDark=false — its 'dark' block is just white fallbacks), so color.dark omitted. Gradients dropped as negligible (two trivial white-to-neutral). radius 3.35e7px/999px normalized to the 9999px pill."
